## Code Example

```javascript
function maskPII(record, fields) {
  const out = {...record};
  fields.forEach(f => {
    if (typeof out[f] === 'string') {
      const v = out[f];
      out[f] = v.replace(/.(?=.{4})/g, '*');
    }
  });
  return out;
}
```

